omx-clap-host (0.23.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * version 0.23.2
  * CI: fetch plugin-hostd-tests' lib from the tag that ships it, keep the
    headers at v0.7.0
  * CI: the plugin-hostd names the tests read follow plugin-hostd v0.13.0
  * CI: install plugin-hostd-contract beside plugin-hostd-devel
  * version 0.23.1
  * commit-message-check: the self-test strings name no private pointer
  * preset_base64_decode refuses a third '=' as soon as it reads it
  * lv2_locate reads a prefixed name in work linear in the manifest
  * fuzz_manifest: the rule compares the prefix only where a ':' follows it
  * Shared verbs that plugin-hostd answers declare -901
  * CI: the commit-message check is the commit-message-check action
  * The e2e tests, benches and socket checks use plugin-hostd-tests' protocol
    client (plugin-hostd#177)
  * tests: dialect_doc_check and ext_table_check each break a scratch copy
    and require red (--self-test)

 -- Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 04:55:13 +0000
